																		Looking for Greenlight on fungal SCP
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tparealm" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6060574); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6060574&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607304980" alt="TPARealm" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6060574)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tparealm" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6060574); return false;" >TPARealm</a></span> <span class="odate time_1607298109 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">06 Dec 2020 23:41</span>
														</div>
